# Publish lexmora-webui on Irancell-T3 (2026-08-23)

## Goal

Ship History full-width / multi-Type / Quiz UI to production behind HAProxy.

## Deploy

- Stack: `lexmora-webui`
- Image: `lexmora-webui:latest` (local build)
- Network: `t3-net`, no host publish
- Volume: `/home/cloud-admin/docker/lexmora-webui`
- Public: https://lexmora.xaigrok.ir → `lexmora-webui:80`

## Fixes during publish

- `run-on-docker-server.ps1`: `$args` → `$MyInvocation.UnboundArguments` (StrictMode)
- `@types/node` + `tsconfig.node.json` `types: ["node"]` for Docker `vue-tsc`
- Removed orphan container name conflict after API stack deploy

## Verify

- HTTPS 200, Let's Encrypt CN=`lexmora.xaigrok.ir`
- SoftEther `ovpbackup.xaigrok.ir` unchanged
- Companion API: https://lexmora-api.xaigrok.ir/api/v1/health → 200
